# tagwheel-2 — шаги записи (что показывается — tagwheel.md, вторая часть)
# Этап 1 — умолчания; этап 2 начинается заходом в настройки.
title tagWheel: where it opens | Start on the Field you choose
open tagWheel.md
caret - call the bank
say Default: tagWheel Left opens on the first Field
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - #todo || call the bank
say Default: tagWheel Right opens on the first Field
cmd open-tagwheel-right
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - #todo || call the bank || 📅2026-10-04

say Active Field on opening → Chosen Field
settings Tags & PKM
set Active Field on opening = Chosen Field
set Left Block active Field = Priority
set Right Block active Field = Project
caret - call the bank
say tagWheel Left opens on Priority
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowDown
key Enter
expect - #high || call the bank
say tagWheel Right opens on Project
cmd open-tagwheel-right
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - #high || call the bank || [[Project A]]
